[en.IDEA_C23_EMERGENCY]
Martial Law

[en.IDEA_C23_EMERGENCY_desc]
Although the Free Equestria is a country built on democratic principles, it is an undeniable fact that the current situation is far from the best time to implement democracy: some threats are using democracy to destroy democracy itself. Therefore, Sunset Shimmer has declared a state of emergency, allowing the Prime Minister to bypass the parliament to implement policies, restrict elections, and authorize the military to use extraordinary measures. It must be admitted that these methods have a dictatorial color, making them only temporary measures. When the time is right, we will definitely return power back to the public.

[zh.IDEA_C23_EMERGENCY]
紧急状态

[zh.IDEA_C23_EMERGENCY_desc]
虽然自由小马利亚是一个建立在民主理念上的国家，但一个不争的事实是当前的情况远非实行民主的最好时候：一些威胁反而利用民主来摧毁民主本身。因此，余晖烁烁已经宣布国家进入紧急状态，允许总理越过国会施行政策、限制选举并授权军队使用非常措施。必须承认这些方法带有专制的色彩，因此这只是权宜之计。等到时机成熟，我们自然会将权力归还给大众。
